{"id":4697,"title":{"romaji":"One Punch Man 3","english":"One-Punch Man Season 3","native":"ワンパンマン３"},"slug":"one_punch_man_3","synopsis":"The third season of One Punch Man.\n\nSaitama is a hero who only became a hero for fun. After three years of \"special training,\" he’s become so strong that he's practically invincible. In fact, he's too strong—even his mightiest opponents are taken out with a single punch. Alongside Genos, his faithful disciple, Saitama performs his official hero duties as a member of the Hero Association.\n\nOne day, monsters claiming to be from the Monster Association suddenly appeared, taking a child of Hero Association executive hostage. The S-class heroes gather and plan a raid on the Monster Association hideout to rescue the hostage. Meanwhile, Garou, a \"human monster\" who was taken by the Monster Association during a battle with the heroes, awakens in the Monster Association hideout.\n\n(Source: EMOTION Label YouTube Channel Description)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2025,"createdAt":"2025-10-22 17:40:48","updatedAt":"2025-10-22 17:40:48","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":153800},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17576},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":46360},{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":11382},{"site":"MAL","externalId":52807},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":null},{"site":"DISNEY_PLUS","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANN","externalId":26230}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":12970,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/Ykr6Q48xUX0tTiMDGRNF91dYDZ6Xu49sHuUTBxOh.avif"},{"id":12971,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/LCnQOqyCFKV6MokVId8QbPpwm7vORsjHKxcKABP5.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":34,"name":"J.C.Staff","slug":"jcstaff"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":200,"name":"One Punch Man","slug":"one_punch_man"}]},"animethemes